#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/mutter.xml:136
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of Mutter"
msgstr "Instalação do Mutter"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/mutter.xml:139
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Fix an issue with the tests that would otherwise require the package to be "
"built with debugging information:"
msgstr ""
"Corrija um problema com os testes que, de outra forma, exigiriam que o "
"pacote fosse construído com informações de depuração:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/mutter.xml:143
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">sed \"/tests_c_args =/s/$/ + ['-U', 'G_DISABLE_ASSERT']/\" -i src/tests/meson.build &amp;&amp;\n"
"sed \"/c_args:/a '-U', 'G_DISABLE_ASSERT',\" -i src/tests/cogl/unit/meson.build</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">sed \"/tests_c_args =/s/$/ + ['-U', 'G_DISABLE_ASSERT']/\" -i src/tests/meson.build &amp;&amp;\n"
"sed \"/c_args:/a '-U', 'G_DISABLE_ASSERT',\" -i src/tests/cogl/unit/meson.build</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/mutter.xml:147
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>Mutter</application> by running the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o <application>Mutter</application> executando os seguintes "
"comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/mutter.xml:151
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup --prefix=/usr            \\\n"
"            --buildtype=release      \\\n"
"            -D tests=disabled        \\\n"
"            -D profiler=false        \\\n"
"            -D bash_completion=false \\\n"
"            ..                       &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup --prefix=/usr            \\\n"
"            --buildtype=release      \\\n"
"            -D tests=disabled        \\\n"
"            -D profiler=false        \\\n"
"            -D bash_completion=false \\\n"
"            ..                       &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/mutter.xml:163
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you want to run the test suite, ensure both <xref linkend='python-"
"dbusmock'/> and <xref linkend='gtk3'/> are installed and issue:"
msgstr ""
"Se você deseja executar a suíte de teste, certifique-se de que <xref "
"linkend='python-dbusmock'/> e <xref linkend='gtk3'/> estejam instalados e "
"emita:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/mutter.xml:168
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>meson configure -D tests=enabled &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja test</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>meson configure -D tests=enabled &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja test</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/mutter.xml:172
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The tests require an active Wayland session. Some tests are flaky "
"(especially if your system is under a high load), so if a test fails you can"
" try to run a specific test again by using the <command>meson test "
"<replaceable>&lt;test name&gt;</replaceable></command> command.  A few tests"
" may fail depending on some system configuration.  Don't make any mouse or "
"keyboard input while the test suite is running or some tests may fail.  You "
"can also test basic functions of <application>Mutter</application> following"
" <xref linkend='mutter-starting'/> after installing this package."
msgstr ""
"Os testes exigem uma sessão ativa do Wayland. Alguns testes são instáveis "
"(especialmente se teu sistema estiver sob uma carga alta), de forma que se "
"um teste falhar, você pode tentar executar um teste específico novamente "
"usando o comando <command>meson test <replaceable>&lt;nome do "
"teste&gt;</replaceable></command>. Alguns testes possivelmente falhem "
"dependendo de alguma configuração do sistema. Não faça nenhuma entrada de "
"mouse ou de teclado enquanto a suíte de teste estiver executando ou alguns "
"testes possivelmente falhem. Você também consegue testar funções básicas do "
"<application>Mutter</application> seguindo <xref linkend='mutter-starting'/>"
" depois de instalar esse pacote."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/mutter.xml:186
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/mutter.xml:189
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/mutter.xml:194
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/mutter.xml:200
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-D bash_completion=false</parameter>: Allows building this "
"package without the <ulink url=\"https://github.com/scop/bash-"
"completion/\">bash-completion</ulink> package installed."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-D bash_completion=false</parameter>: Permite construir esse "
"pacote sem o pacote <ulink url=\"https://github.com/scop/bash-"
"completion/\">bash-completion</ulink> instalado."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/mutter.xml:207
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-D tests=disabled</parameter>: Allows building this package "
"without <xref linkend='python-dbusmock'/> installed.  It'll be overridden "
"with <command>meson configure</command> if running the test suite."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-D tests=disabled</parameter>: Permite construir esse pacote sem "
"<xref linkend='python-dbusmock'/> instalado. Ela será substituída por "
"<command>meson configure</command> se executar a suíte de teste."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/mutter.xml:214
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-D profiler=false</parameter>: Allows building this package "
"without <application>Sysprof</application>.  Remove this option if you've "
"installed <application>Sysprof</application> and want to analyze the "
"rendering performance of <application>Mutter</application>."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-D profiler=false</parameter>: Permite construir esse pacote sem "
"<application>Sysprof</application>. Remova essa opção se você não tiver "
"instalado o <application>Sysprof</application> e desejar analisar o "
"desempenho de renderização do <application>Mutter</application>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/mutter.xml:221
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>-D x11=true</option>: Allows building this package with X11 support."
" X11 support is deprecated and will be removed in GNOME 50."
msgstr ""
"<option>-D x11=true</option>: Permite construir esse pacote com suporte a "
"X11. O suporte a X11 está obsoleto e será removido no GNOME 50."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/mutter.xml:228
#, xml-text
msgid "Starting Mutter"
msgstr "Iniciando o Mutter"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/mutter.xml:237
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<application>Mutter</application> is normally used as a component of "
"<application>gnome-shell</application>, but it can be used as a standalone "
"Wayland compositor too.  To run <application>Mutter</application> as a "
"Wayland compositor, in a virtual console, issue:"
msgstr ""
"<application>Mutter</application> normalmente é usado como um componente do "
"<application>gnome-shell</application>, mas também pode ser usado como um "
"compositor autônomo Wayland. Para executar <application>Mutter</application>"
" como um compositor Wayland, em um console virtual, emita:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/mutter.xml:244
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>mutter --wayland -- vte-2.91</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>mutter --wayland -- vte-2.91</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/mutter.xml:247
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Replace <command>vte-2.91</command> with the command line for the first "
"application you want in the Wayland session. Note that once this application"
" exits, the Wayland session will be terminated."
msgstr ""
"Substitua <command>vte-2.91</command> pela linha de comando do primeiro "
"aplicativo que você deseja na sessão do Wayland. Observe que assim que esse "
"aplicativo sair, a sessão do Wayland será terminada."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/mutter.xml:253
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<application>Mutter</application> can also function as a nested compositor "
"in another Wayland session.  In a terminal emulator, issue:"
msgstr ""
"<application>Mutter</application> também pode funcionar como um compositor "
"aninhado em outra sessão do Wayland. Em um emulador de terminal, emita:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/mutter.xml:257
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>MUTTER_DEBUG_DUMMY_MODE_SPECS=1920x1080 \\\n"
"dbus-run-session mutter --wayland --devkit -- vte-2.91</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>MUTTER_DEBUG_DUMMY_MODE_SPECS=1920x1080 \\\n"
"dbus-run-session mutter --wayland --devkit -- vte-2.91</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/mutter.xml:261
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"There will be a 20-second delay before the nested compositor starts up "
"because of <ulink "
"url='https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/mutter/-/issues/4159'>a known "
"bug</ulink>.  Replace <replaceable>1920x1080</replaceable> with the size you"
" want for the nested Wayland session."
msgstr ""
"Existirá um atraso de 20 segundos antes do compositor aninhado iniciar "
"devido <ulink url='https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/mutter/-/issues/4159'>a "
"defeito conhecido</ulink>. Substitua <replaceable>1920x1080</replaceable> "
"pelo tamanho que você quiser para a sessão aninhada Wayland."

