#~ "The test suite requires the mutter schema to be installed on the system, so "
#~ "it is better to run the tests after installing the package.  You can also "
#~ "test basic functions of <application>Mutter</application> following <xref "
#~ "linkend='mutter-starting' role=','/> after installing it."
